    "title": "Benjamin - Earn Cash Rewards",
    "description": "Unleash the Full Power of Your Phone and Start Getting Paid Real Cash Rewards From Playing Games, Making Purchases, Doing Surveys, Watching Videos and All Kinds of Money Moments with Benjamin \u2014 The Best Money Stacking App!\r\n\r\nAre you a mobile game lover, savvy shopper or a deal-seeker who wants to turn their hobby into a paid job, or simply someone who is looking for the best new legit money-making app? Look no further! Benjamin is a one-stop-shop app that revolutionizes how you earn and save on your every day life. Here\u2019s what you can do to stack extra cash-rewards with Benjamin:\r\n\r\nEffortlessly Turn Playtime into Paytime - Earn Money From Testing & Playing Mobile Games \r\n\r\nGet access to over 1,000 games that not only entertain but also fill your wallet with the highest real money rewards on the market. You play, we pay, you earn extra money! Start this new effective side hustle and easily earn $10+ a day with playing games from your home! With our wide selection of games you can get paid to play casual, puzzle, merge -games like Monopoly Go, Bingo Blitz, Alice's Dream, BlackJack, Solitaire and many other games.\r\n\r\nStack Your Cash Back: Earn extra cash back on top of your existing credit or debit card rewards every time you use your card. Plus, get boosted cash back on purchases at places like Dollar Tree, Target, Starbucks, Walmart, Nike, Lululemon, and all your other favorite brands\r\n\r\nExclusive Surveys: Get paid to share your opinion! Participate in surveys for money and boost your earnings effortlessly.\r\n\r\nBenjamin Travel: Plan your dream getaway and save big on hotels with Benjamin Travel. With up to 40% cash back on bookings, your perfect vacation is closer than you think.\r\n\r\nGift Cards: Shop your heart out and stack even more cash back! Buy gift cards for all the major brands in the US and earn cash back from all of those purchases too. \r\n\r\nAutomated Savings with Mobile Safari Extension: Forget the hassle of coupon hunting; our automated Safari browser extension does all the work for you and notifies you every time there is a coupon or offer available at the store you are browsing!\r\n\r\nUnique Shopping Offers: We give you exclusive deals you won't find elsewhere, making your shopping experience guilt-free and more rewarding.\r\n\r\nEarn with Referrals: Invite friends and businesses for unlimited referral rewards and sign up bonuses.\r\n\r\nLoyalty Tiers: Unlock exclusive rewards and cash back boosts as you progress through the Benjamin loyalty tiers. The more you claim cash rewards - the bigger the rewards become!\r\n\r\nSurprise Bonuses: Get delightful surprises and extra rewards when you use our app! Experience the thrill of unexpected perks and cash-rewards and make your shopping even more rewarding.\r\n\r\nExperience seamless shopping, saving, and earning, all rolled into one app. Benjamin is not just an app; it's a lifestyle that maximizes your savings and earnings like never before. Don't just spend\u2014earn and save with Benjamin! \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHow Benjamin Works\r\n\r\n1. Earn with Rewarding Tasks: With Benjamin, you can also earn cashback without making purchases. Boost your monthly earnings by doing rewarding tasks such as playing games, watching ads, or participating in surveys. With Benjamin, you have a legit way to earn cash rewards without having to make any purchases.\r\n2. Shop, Earn, Save & Stack Cash Back: Use your card as usual and earn cash rewards on every purchase and boosted cash back at 1M+ locations.\r\n3. Invite & Earn Referral Bonuses: Share your referral link and earn unlimited referral rewards.\r\n4. Repeat: Come back daily and claim your rewards to watch your cash rewards amount grow!\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re looking for an alternative to Pogo, Fetch, Bridge Money, Dosh, Swagbucks, Mistplay, or Rakuten, do like tens of thousands others and switch to Benjamin and start saving money effortlessly without changing your spending habits.",
